{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Keep Me Gifted \u2013 Start Your Own Shop, Package, Sell, and Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/finale.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong>, A fun, engaging and sometimes a little <strong>chaotic</strong> simulation experience is now available in early access</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/pricing.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your journey with a small gift shop and grow your business step by step. In <strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong>, you begin by naming your store, stocking your shelves with charming items, setting prices, and serving customers. Your goal is to maximize customer satisfaction, increase sales, and build a successful business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/cargofinal.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, you won\u2019t just rely on walk-in customers\u2014online orders will start rolling in. Every day, a delivery driver will come to collect your prepared packages, so timely and accurate packaging is key. Fast and correct packing, tailored to each order, can <strong>push your shop to the top.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/box_cutter.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made a mistake while packing? No worries. You can open the box with a utility knife and fix the order before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/stickers.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add some fun to your packages with <strong>stickers</strong> and <strong>decorations</strong> to bring a smile to your customers\u2019 faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/credit_card.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customers can pay with either <strong>cash</strong> or <strong>card</strong>, but don\u2019t forget to collect the payment and return the correct change. Even small mistakes can affect customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/welp.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core of the game is to grow your shop using smart sales strategies, earn high ratings through positive customer reviews, and become a successful small business owner. With its fun packaging mechanics, business simulation elements, and daily tasks, <strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong> offers a delightful and rewarding experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/bouvier.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone, meet Madame Bouvier! Our towns very own fortune-teller and witch! She has a few screws loose (as any fortuneteller should\u2026) but she still gets the job done! Wait for her to visit your shops and draw your card! &quot;What will i get\u201d you may ask? Only she and her chart knows. She is a little spacey sometimes, but i will tell you this much, every benevolent card has a counterpart ranging from Tax evasion charms to double the rent curses. So choose wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/shop_upgrade.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong> is both fun and strategic. Bring out your inner shopkeeper, break sales records, and <strong>build your very own gift shop empire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/logo.png?t=1751555575\" /></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"SALES MASTER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649900/2394582c3aff5e6891474dab74dac3289d8480a9.jpg"},{"name":"LEARNING EXPERIENCE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649900/855ae800d6cefebf20094cf20015eee97316613b.jpg"},{"name":"UP AND AWAY","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649900/968245db5b1af836207f77b19850a8065355e04e.jpg"},{"name":"DISMAL STYLE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649900/d58a3a6801219d7677022884eceebd08afe94103.jpg"},{"name":"SSSUPER STYLE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649900/e817d1ba60207fb6eaaa1b690314f9a65ca1586e.jpg"},{"name":"THAT SHOULD DO IT ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649900/6cb2e0a0ab8420ce67a56a97480f6ecd6c41093b.jpg"},{"name":"MONEY MONEY MONEY GIFTWRAPPA","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649900/2d56255d0a4c4e7b8d33934f4e87be7b25f69c05.jpg"},{"name":"OOPS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649900/c208daebd83853677f987a4dbf9c263cc0c8fbda.jpg"},{"name":"I DID IT AGAIN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649900/d495d22d854c967f704d78c295f8ac1a83d2596f.jpg"},{"name":"I PLAYED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3649900/88f772349ae3410deb407fae421cbaca90d131e7.jpg"}],"total":26},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649900?t=1751555575","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/4f74c9f23b00d77a56a24a3c59628f1ef1fa1de7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751555575","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/261c0959813f538a3c269d95293f5e8282921a7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751555575","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/261c0959813f538a3c269d95293f5e8282921a7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751555575","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Keep Me Gifted \u2013 Start Your Own Shop, Package, Sell, and Grow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/finale.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong>, A fun, engaging and sometimes a little <strong>chaotic</strong> simulation experience is now available in early access</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/pricing.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Start your journey with a small gift shop and grow your business step by step. In <strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong>, you begin by naming your store, stocking your shelves with charming items, setting prices, and serving customers. Your goal is to maximize customer satisfaction, increase sales, and build a successful business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/cargofinal.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you progress, you won\u2019t just rely on walk-in customers\u2014online orders will start rolling in. Every day, a delivery driver will come to collect your prepared packages, so timely and accurate packaging is key. Fast and correct packing, tailored to each order, can <strong>push your shop to the top.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/box_cutter.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Made a mistake while packing? No worries. You can open the box with a utility knife and fix the order before it\u2019s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/stickers.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Add some fun to your packages with <strong>stickers</strong> and <strong>decorations</strong> to bring a smile to your customers\u2019 faces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/credit_card.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customers can pay with either <strong>cash</strong> or <strong>card</strong>, but don\u2019t forget to collect the payment and return the correct change. Even small mistakes can affect customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/welp.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The core of the game is to grow your shop using smart sales strategies, earn high ratings through positive customer reviews, and become a successful small business owner. With its fun packaging mechanics, business simulation elements, and daily tasks, <strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong> offers a delightful and rewarding experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/bouvier.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everyone, meet Madame Bouvier! Our towns very own fortune-teller and witch! She has a few screws loose (as any fortuneteller should\u2026) but she still gets the job done! Wait for her to visit your shops and draw your card! &quot;What will i get\u201d you may ask? Only she and her chart knows. She is a little spacey sometimes, but i will tell you this much, every benevolent card has a counterpart ranging from Tax evasion charms to double the rent curses. So choose wisely!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/shop_upgrade.gif?t=1751555575\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep Me Gifted</strong> is both fun and strategic. Bring out your inner shopkeeper, break sales records, and <strong>build your very own gift shop empire.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/extras/logo.png?t=1751555575\" /></div></p>","developers":["Merlot Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649900/1b2823e82c38644b1ed3b900a521e7eb0422dcf9/header.jpg?t=1751555575","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 10.13 High Sierra or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 and Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133215,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133215/movie480.mp4?t=1747147182","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133215/movie_max.mp4?t=1747147182"},"name":"Early Access Cinematic Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133215/d92fe0c7a68fbb6d4ab6feaa542ad4d1e03d8185/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747147182","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133215/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747147182","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133215/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747147182"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257158349,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2